WEBVTT

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.610
Nigel, the idling is a little unstable.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.560
I wonder if I might have revved
the engine too high?

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:36.400
It's fine at higher revolutions, but
when it's low, it becomes unstable.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:44.500
It looks like she's going to make
some new hard suits.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.970
I'll be there later.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:22.310
This is Salusa Source. I'm patrolling
over the submerged city.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.850
There appears to be no suspicious activity.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.610
Roger.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.350
Hi, Leon-chan! What occasion
brings you to a place like this?

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.900
How many times do I have to tell you,
not to add "chan" to my name?!

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:45.700
I'm sorry! I won't call you that
anymore, Leon-chan.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.840
Give that back to me.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.350
What did you just say?

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:58.450
I won't call you that.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.720
After that...

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.950
Leon-cha...

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:04.120
Leon, Sir!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.610
Good!

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.360
You big coward!

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.770
Hey, the archive here has records
on almost everything, doesn't it?

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:16.470
So what?

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.440
How much has been collected
on the Knight Sabers?

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.240
I don't know if we have any
records like that or not.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.170
You haven't checked the records yet?

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:25.770
I don't know.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.680
You can look for it, can't you?

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:33.280
Is that the proper way to ask for a favor?

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:37.510
Please, look for it!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.690
It's THAT time, isn't it?

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:15.250
What's wrong? You're looking at your hands.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:27.300
It's almost a crime to type with such
beautiful, elegant fingers. Isn't it?

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.640
Keep dreaming.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.680
I didn't expect it to be so hard.

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.280
I wonder if I'll be able to make it?

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.090
That's it?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:50.860
Yes, that's it. I think this
transmission was jammed.

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:55.300
Every time the Knight Sabers appear,
there's noise in the reception.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.270
I see!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.330
Thank you!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.610
You've heard from Priss, haven't you?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.740
I brought all the parts.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.350
Go down to the pit, and wait.

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:48.240
There's data about her body size
in the simulator booth.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:58.200
That girl is the new member. Her name
is Linna. She's cute, isn't she?

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.800
She's the one that Priss found.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:06.100
Isn't it odd that she wants a
new member to join us?

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.700
The core's been removed, right?

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.890
Of course.

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:45.970
This was suppose to be a backup for
Priss, but I guess we can use it.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:52.450
I have some new tricks to try with this hard suit.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.470
Sure, do whatever you want.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.440
See you later! Take care!

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.820
Do you have some time?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:45.340
Nene-chan, what made you
join the Knight Sabers?

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:49.070
Same as you, Linna. It looked interesting.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.840
How did you join?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.210
Let's see...

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:57.880
In my case, I discovered Sylia accessing
the Genom server, and got in touch.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.250
That was the beginning.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.520
Well, I can say she was attracted to my abilities.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:06.220
You don't look like you're very good at athletics.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:10.190
I don't just support them from behind!

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:13.060
When I put on my suit, mad boomers will be...

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:22.440
Don't look away, you bitch!

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:24.910
What are you going to do about my clothes?!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:31.820
I'm very sorry. I'll bring a cleaner right away.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.380
I'm not talking about things like that.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:38.090
You're a boomer! Show a little
respect for humans!

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:42.890
I don't like men like that. He can only
express his anger by abusing boomers.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.060
I feel sorry for her.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.130
What shall I do to satisfy you, Sir?

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.000
Clean it by licking it off.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.910
Excuse me, but that's enough!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.580
You pervert!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.920
What did you say?!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.750
Oh, geez! She's making a scene.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.560
I'm educating this boomer. Do you
have a problem with that?!

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:18.360
I see. I wonder if you also educate
your girlfriend the same way?

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:25.360
Shut the hell up! Don't confuse
boomers with humans.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:31.960
Thank you very much.
Please come back again.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:40.280
I wonder if I can do it?

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:43.490
If you don't have the confidence,
why don't you quit now?

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:47.060
It will be exciting but frightening when
you put on your hard suit.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.230
The time limitation on the battery
metal is pretty short.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:53.130
Mad boomers move around, and it's
impossible to predict their movements.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.800
So we have to be flexible in our
approach when dealing with them.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:00.260
So a person who lacks confidence
is nothing but trouble.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:10.180
But I wasn't able to move around very
well at the beginning the way Priss did.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:14.340
She's special. There's no use
trying to compete with her.

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:17.280
I understand.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.590
Let's do our best!

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.930
Thank you, Nene-chan.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.700
Could you stop calling me "chan"?

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:28.900
Sorry, Nene.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.300
Good!

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.950
Knight Sabers...

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:50.350
Our Investigation Division hasn't been
able to find anything on them.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.890
Why don't we leave them alone then?

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:59.500
They've voluntarily dealt with the
mad boomers, haven't they?

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:06.340
Will it be all right if people find out
that boomers may not only go mad,

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:09.270
but that their physical structure
may malfunction as well?

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:13.140
That's not a possibility, Mason.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.510
Sir?

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:20.480
Why do you think we've invested
so much in the AD Police?

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:23.890
They were originally established as
a special anti-terrorist force.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:27.860
They rely on firearms too much when
dealing with mad boomers.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:31.690
I guess their skills will improve with time.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:39.100
The most important thing is that the
AD Police are hated by society.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:44.210
Their actions are usually criticized by
the press as being overblown.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:49.840
They're idiots who use armored cars to
deal with slightly unstable boomers.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.790
But the Knight Sabers are...

00:10:55.790 --> 00:11:03.760
I have pressured the media not to report
on that organization of vigilantes.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:11.860
The AD Police and the Knight Sabers
are dealing with a non-existent threat.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.030
Mad boomers and such don't exist.

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:19.910
I'm a child.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:24.980
A child is supposed to demand what he
wants, even if he has to cry to get it.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.180
I understand.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:41.700
Excuse me, take our order!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.130
Stop that! You're too loud, and it's embarrassing.

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:46.600
But I'm so hungry.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.330
This restaurant is pretty good,
and has big portions!

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.680
Sylia!

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.950
I wonder if she's in the pit?

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:20.570
Oh, Nigel is here.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.770
Linna, your hard suit might be ready!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.440
Oh, Nigel!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:34.510
Nice to meet you! I'm Linna Yamazaki.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.430
Well, I'll call you when we need maintenance.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.840
Oh, welcome.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:53.960
Good afternoon.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.750
What the hell are you doing here?!

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:11.250
The battery's already dead?
What useless crap!

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:19.690
What is this?! This isn't fair!

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:30.840
This is too much equipment for a new suit!

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.710
It's because Nigel told me he wanted to try it.

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:35.370
It's sexy, isn't it?

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.220
Because your figure is beautiful,

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:41.840
we were able to make the shape
of the hard suit beautiful.

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.090
Excuse me...

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.990
Yes?

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.650
Can I try it on?

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.760
Save me!

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:22.250
This might be a little too tight for me.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:29.390
That inner suit will transmit your
controls to the hard suit.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.170
Right!

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:33.140
Geez!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.380
Mad boomer!

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.850
Please stop!

00:14:58.360 --> 00:15:02.370
Inside it's a little cold, but be
patient at the beginning.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.660
Relax and get in slowly.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:10.770
It's so cold.

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:16.870
Next, put your arms in.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.640
Excuse me!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.870
I will release the suit from the hanger.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:02.120
This looked really heavy, but it's so light!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.930
It's dangerous to move around
like that in the beginning.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.400
You should get used to it gradually.

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:21.140
A mad boomer has appeared
in the 24th block.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.990
They made a boomer with a
female shape, that's why!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.590
What shall we do, Sylia?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.390
We might not have time to transfer
the mobile pit to Priss's location.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.490
Hurry up and go right now, Nene!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.830
What? By myself?

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.920
There's someone else, isn't there?

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:06.310
Run!

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:22.570
It's reckless to let her go into
an actual battle so soon.

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:25.630
You wanted to be a Knight Saber, didn't you?

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:31.810
Why don't you try doing what
you've always wanted to?

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.250
Right!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:37.120
Both of you, pay attention to
each other's battery metal.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.820
Sure!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:39.950
Linna, let's go!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:45.190
Now, please get in here.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:47.230
What? Nene, where's your suit?

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:51.800
Actually, we put our suits on inside here,

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.000
but, Linna, yours was just finished today.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.340
Is that so?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.270
Well, please get in.

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:00.210
What?! By myself?!

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:04.350
That's right. Hurry up already!
Close your seal properly.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.480
What seal?!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.810
On your helmet!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.930
It's time to go. Be prepared,
because it's pretty rough.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.660
Right!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.710
Knight Sabers, action!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.150
Yahoo!

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:07.880
Linna, as soon as you touch the ground, jump!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:12.450
The booster will activate automatically,
so keep your balance in the air.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:13.510
I'll try!

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:21.790
You're doing so well! How annoying!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:25.090
I'm flying!

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:28.000
This is incredible! I can't believe I'm so light!

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:37.470
Don't fly that high!

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:40.440
How come you can fly higher than me?!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:47.980
Where is my hard suit?

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:50.520
Priss, hurry up and get out of there.

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.350
The AD Police are approaching.

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.060
What are you going to do about this thing?

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:57.390
The Knight Sabers will handle it.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.460
A mad boomer has appeared in the 24th block.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:04.830
It appears to be attacking a female
customer inside the store.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.470
I would never have imagined that a
waitress boomer could go mad.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.670
I guess she was stressed out.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:16.610
Let's go!

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:19.220
The mad boomer process is pretty advanced.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.920
I wonder if a regular bullet will work on it?

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.940
We can't rely on backup.

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.620
That cafeteria, we were just there!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.090
Oh, God! The AD Police are already here!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.590
Hurry up, Priss is trapped inside!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.560
Next Episode

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.230
What the hell is this?
What are you thinking?

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:04.730
I can't believe you let an amateur
join an actual battle!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.530
I don't understand what Linna
and Sylia are thinking.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:11.370
I refuse to team up with an amateur like her!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.170
What? Linna's been captured by the boomer?

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:18.480
But her battery metal will only
last for a short while!

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:20.740
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
